  "description": "A .NET 10 redistribution of the International Components for Unicode (ICU) version 77 native binaries for macOS, packaged for the CodeBrix family. Ships universal (x86_64 + arm64) libicuuc.dylib + libicudata.dylib for the osx runtime identifier, the full ICU 77 data archive (icudt.dat, ~5.5 MB), and a buildTransitive .targets pair that auto-embeds the data archive as an EmbeddedResource at consumer-build time.",
